N5008 [temp.deduct]/5 + [basic.scope.temp]/2: a partial specialization
impl<false, F, A...> used twice with different arities; its member typedef
decltype(_S_test<F, A...>(0)) and a base-specifier impl<...>::type must see
the instance's OWN bindings (the libstdc++ __result_of_impl /
__invoke_result shape, a void- then int-returning std::bind).
